   "text": "ev:{source}:{issuer_cik}:{params_hash}            market 60 s · news 15 min\nqe:{embedding_fp}:{sha256(normalized_query)}      exact only, no cosine reuse\nrr:{index_release}:{retrieval_cfg_fp}:{q}:{f}     release lifetime\nmemo:{snapshot_hash}:{prompt_v}:{model_fp}:{verifier_policy_fp}\nlock:memo:{same suffix}    SET NX PX           single-flight per snapshot\nrl:{customer_id}:{window}                         fail-safe if Valkey is lost\n\nembedding_fp = model + version + dims + preprocessing\nquotas live in Postgres · losing Valkey loses no job",
